This file exists so the absence is explicit rather than accidental. Until a
licence is added here and in package.json, no permission to copy, modify or
redistribute is granted, and `package.json` stays `"private": true` so the
package cannot be published to npm by mistake.

The owner of this repository must pick a licence before any release, any
publication, or any invitation for outside contributions.
